{"client":"goose","transport":"mcacp","wiring":"snippet","prereqs":"tau installed and configured — `tau doctor` reports an ok provider and API key; Node.js with `npx` on the PATH Goose sees — the bridge runs as `npx -y mcacp` (or install it once with `npm i -g mcacp`)","setup":"tau setup --client goose --yes","config_dir":"~/.config/goose","settings_path":"~/.config/goose/config.yaml","snippet_path":"~/.config/tau/snippets/goose.yaml","bridge_path":"~/.config/mcacp/mcacp.json","verify":"install mcacp (npm i -g mcacp or npx), merge the snippet into ~/.config/goose/config.yaml, then run 'goose session' and ask about the mcacp tools","doctor_check":"client_goose","docs":"https://github.com/javimosch/tau/blob/master/docs/clients/goose.md"}
